OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUni explores link between
OL,4,Amigraines and hallucinations
OL,5,
OL,6,FA team of Lancashire scientists have
OL,7,Fembarked on a mission to better
OL,8,Funderstand why people who have
OL,9,Fmigraines often develop strong
OL,10,Fhallucinations and distortions in the
OL,11,Fbrain.
OL,13,FThe study, led by neuroscientist Jason
OL,14,FBraithwaite at Lancaster University,
OL,15,Faims to find out more about those who
OL,16,Fhave hallucinations, which appears to
OL,17,Fbe due to the brain becoming
OL,18,F"overloaded" with information.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40302
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1794642973
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUni explores link between
OL,4,Amigraines and hallucinations
OL,5,
OL,6,FBraithwaite said the most fascinating
OL,7,Fpart about the study was that many
OL,8,Fpeople will have hallucinations,
OL,9,Fofficially called "visual aura",
OL,10,Fwithout realising they are having a
OL,11,Fmigraine.
OL,13,F"Quite often people will go quite far
OL,14,Fthrough their lives without realising
OL,15,Fthat these occasional experiences
OL,16,Fthey're having are actually part of
OL,17,Fhaving a migraine," he said.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
